### 50. [2026-03-20 ~03:00] AD-1: 統一判定原則 (Single Source of Truth)
build_gold_standard() 是所有 resolved_at 判定的唯一來源。main loop 只負責跑模型、收集資料。任何 resolution path 的最終判定都必須經過 build_gold_standard()，不得在 main loop 直接存 gold standard。此原則來自 5 個 tracking bugs 的教訓。

### 50a. [2026-03-20 ~03:30] Bug 1-5 deep audit and fix
go /plan mode to deeply investigate my correction (based on 3 rounds logic and mini patch triggering logic). Found: Bug 1 (Trigger 1 → unresolved), Bug 2 (Trigger 2 missing from summary), Bug 3 (prompt_evolution duplicate — 確立 AD-1 原則), Bug 4 (Trigger 1 duplicate in all_disagreed), Bug 5 (R3 unresolved no continue). All fixed: Trigger 1/2 collect to separate lists, build_gold_standard() processes them, all_disagreed.remove() on trigger, summary counts r2_model_patch and r2_early_evolution.

### 50b. [2026-03-20 ~04:00] survey2_fhl_sn_format_spec/ — 教科書級別 SN 格式總整理
search very deeply on all components for FHL SN denoting. Created textbook-level reference consolidating format definitions from 10+ files. W-prefix decode, tag types, numeric classification, 900x mapping, morphology codes, normalization pipeline, regex cross-reference.

### 51. [2026-03-20 ~08:30] AI Problem Classification — 學術定位
重新解釋一下我們這個整體邏輯, 這算是怎樣的 AI 解題類型? 1) 有參考範例(UNV+SN), 2) 對未知資料仿效insert SN, 3) 成果先不給人類評判. → 結論: Few-shot cross-lingual Annotation Projection (標注投射) + LLM-as-Judge + LLM-Ensemble. 逐 round 對應學術典型: R1=Cross-Model Self-Consistency, R2 Convergence=Test-Retest Reliability, R2 Debate=Multi-Agent Debate, R3=Meta-Judgment with Escape Hatch, Prompt Evolution=APE with Regression Gate. Trigger 2 的 cross-model peer review → self-patch 是獨創設計.

### 51a. [2026-03-20 ~09:00] Instability Score → Patch 力度 3 級分級
調查 max-r2-retries=0 (=unlimited) 與 easy/hard threshold (R2a 分界) 是獨立機制後, 設計並實作 instability score: unique outputs count → mild(3)/moderate(4)/strong(5+/unstable). Feedback prompt 按級別加強 (mild=標準, moderate=+oscillation analysis+root cause, strong=+past trigger2 history+prescriptive rules). Self-patch prompt 同樣分級. 回測 sampling 也按級別調整 (10%/20%/30%). AI_PROBLEM_CLASSIFICATION.md 記錄完整學術背景與設計決策.

