if I want to add the phrase "this is about Few-shot Cross-lingual Annotation Projection" and make it prompt 1.2, what do you think? → Decided: not a +0.1 (human-initiated, not error-driven). Run as parallel experiment first. Label + actionable implications (not just academic name). Created v1.1-exp-annotation-projection.md.

